  "details": "Description\n\nLive users cannot see physbone grabbing and posing of open beta users and vice versa. Using release pose also does not fix it, things remain posed in the other client regardless.\n\nReproduction Steps\n\nIf a user on the other client version grabs or poses a physbone on you or others, you won't be able to fix it or see it.\n\nDetails\n\n- Category: Avatar\n\n- Frequency: Always\n\n---\n\nplatform: PC (platform: Windows, store: Steam, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: WindowsPlayer\n\nclientVersion: 2026.4.2-1949-1134d5e8be-Release\n\nunityVersion: 6000.0.67f1-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report\n\n---",
